[[2047,31,32768,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The boot opening switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends an earth signal, with\nthe boot open, to integrated services control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40.</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              (pin\n14 of connector C) and simultaneously to boot light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply for the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT) by the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 7 of connector B) and directly\nfrom the battery. (maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) up to 2/99\nor of B99 from 2/99.) through fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F8</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n8 of connector B).</p><p>When the signal that the boot is open arrives,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the timed supply signal, from\npin 2 of connector C, which operates the boot light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply for the glove compartment light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT/A) by the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up\nto 2/99 or fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from\n2/99, and is activated by an earth signal from the glove compartment\nswitch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply for the sun visor light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G32</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT) by the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and is activated by the switch inside\nthe actual light.</p>"]]